","value":8,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3196560","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1847286114044307","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"update","title":"Skateboard Knight Demo Update (Ver.1.1.1)","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo of Skateboard Knight! We've released a new update today to improve the game experience. Bug Fixes [*] Fixed a bug where, when using the mouse at the Blacksmith, left-clicking a weapon in the \"Modify\" menu would darken the screen and make it impossible to operate. *With this fix, the mouse controls on the weapon selection screen have changed. Long press: Display weapon details Click: Confirm weapon Version Confirmation Confirm game version in the top-left of the men","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:59:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044307","verified_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1846651706694395","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Adjusted Based on Feedback!","summary":"Thank you for playing the Skateboard Knight demo! We've been receiving all kinds of feedback about the demo through social media and our community. Some of you have been supporting this game since 2024 and have watched it grow along the way. The entire development team is truly grateful. Since the demo released on October 8, we've pushed out an update that includes various adjustments based on your feedback. This covers rebalancing game balance, improving various screens, and making the game mor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:13:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694395","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1846651706680022","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"update","title":"Skateboard Knight Demo Update (Ver.1.1.0)","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo of Skateboard Knight! We've released a new update today to improve the game experience. Bug Fixes Fixed a bug where the game would crash under certain conditions when playing Ver.1.0.7 using Ver.1.0.4 save data. *This fix does NOT require you to recreate your save data. Version Confirmation Confirm game version in the top-left of the menu by opening the settings menu during gameplay. ════════════════════════ PLAYISM Visit the PLAYISM Website PLAYISM Publisher Page ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:15:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1846651706676955","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"update","title":"Skateboard Knight Demo Update (Ver. 1.0.7)","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo of Skateboard Knight! We've released a new update today to improve the game experience. Patch Notes Changes & Improvements Adjusted Perfect Bonuses and EXP earned from enemies to make leveling up easier, even without obtaining Perfect Bonuses. Fairy of Magnetism Improvements: -Now attracts EXP and coins from behind you as well. -Reduced cooldown time. Adjusted the placement of EXP and coins dropped by defeated bosses so that all of them can be collected. Changed th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:33:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1846018067928341","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"announcement","title":"Skateboard Knight Demo released today!","summary":"Ahead of Steam Next Fest, the latest demo version of Skateboard Knight has been released today! In this demo, the game system has been significantly improved from the previous version. You can enjoy not only exhilarating action, but also various permanent upgrades such as leveling up Skateboard Knight and weapon crafting. Grow your knight as you aim for boss battles against powerful enemies and even more stages! Please take this opportunity to play Skateboard Knight and add it to your Steam wish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T04:54:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1843481262691805","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo showcase confirmed for TGS2026!","summary":"Easy to pick up yet deeply satisfying action RPG-style roguelite Skateboard Knight has been confirmed for a demo showcase at TGS2026! In the demo version, you can play through the game's early stages! Grow your Skateboard Knight and aim to take on boss battles and unlock further stages! All visitors who try the demo will receive a \"Skateboard Knight Acrylic Stand\" with rollers that actually move like a real skateboard—play with it by rolling it around! Come visit us and give it a try for yoursel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T10:40:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691805","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3061730-1797820624490148","game_id":"steam-3061730","kind":"announcement","title":"Skateboard Knight to be Published by PLAYISM!","summary":"Casually save the world on a skateboard! PLAYISM is proud to announce that we will be publishing Skateboard Knight, the action RPG-esque roguelite by Maroru Games! The controls are simple: just move up and down to pick a lane. Horizontal movement and attacks are all automatic! Please wishlist the game and look forward to future announcements for this laid back but surprisingly deep action RPG-esque roguelite! We also have a demo here on Steam, so please try it out! https://store.steampowered.com","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-25T11:01:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797820624490148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3061730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3061730":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3061730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:41Z"},"3196560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3061730","app_id":3061730,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3cbc21c73da1cb7d665d2bc85a3fbfb03ce3b14354cd1219939c6b081196efae","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"H